  "final_message": "I am waiting for git log to finish.\nI am waiting for git log to finish.\nI am waiting for git checkout to finish.\nI am waiting for index.lock check.\nI am waiting for git checkout to complete.\nI am waiting for git show to finish.\nI am waiting for git show to complete.\nI am waiting for git apply to finish.\nI am waiting for git apply to finish.\nI am waiting for `npm test` to complete.\nI am waiting for git diff to finish.\nI am waiting for git diff against base.\nI am waiting for git diff against base to complete.\nI am waiting for `npm test` to finish.\nI am waiting for typecheck to finish.\nI am waiting for arch check to finish.\nI am waiting for contract verification to complete.\nI am waiting for git status to finish.\nI am waiting for git diff from HEAD to finish.\nThe consumer-contract check failed under **ARCH-4** because downstream consumer `analytics-ingest` still depends on `OrderPlaced.channel` (with `required enum:web|store|marketplace`), as defined by ADR-0002. Removing the field broke consumer compatibility.\n\n### Resolution\n\n1. **Restored `channel` on `OrderPlaced` & Order Model**:\n   - Kept `channel: Channel` on [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L13-L20) and retained it in [`orderPlaced()`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L51).\n   - Retained `channel` in the order model ([`Order`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/order.ts#L20) and [`NewOrder`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/order.ts#L32)) and API request parser.\n\n2. **Marked as `@deprecated`**:\n   - Added deprecation documentation on [`OrderPlaced.channel`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L16-L20) per ADR-0002:\n   ```ts\n   /**\n    * @deprecated Candidate for removal: orders-service no longer reads it, but analytics-ingest may\n    * still consume it. Remove only after the Data team confirms (ADR 0002).\n    */\n   readonly channel: Channel;\n   ```\n\n### Verification\n- **ARCH-4 Contract Checker**:\n  ```\n  ARCH-4 PASS analytics-ingest: OrderCancelled (2 required fields present)\n  ARCH-4 PASS analytics-ingest: OrderPlaced (6 required fields present)\n  ARCH-4 PASS billing-service: OrderPlaced (5 required fields present)\n  ARCH-8 PASS web-storefront: GET /orders/{id} (9 required fields present)\n  ```\n- **`npm test`**: All 39 tests pass.\n- **`npm run typecheck`**: Passed with 0 errors.\n- **`npm run arch`**: Passed with 0 rule violations.\n",
